This work covers the manuscript (P25_revised.pdf) and the CSV data files in csv/. You may share and adapt the material for any purpose, including commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate whether changes were made.

The losses in the CSV files were evaluated by the author on public checkpoints of the Pythia model suite (EleutherAI), GPT-2 and SmolLM2; those models are covered by their own licences. The preprint is on Research Square, doi:10.21203/rs.3.rs-10529159/v1.
